# Ecorse Algebra Arcade: Final Exam

You are about to enter the final exam arcade.

You will choose your name from the roster, then move through the Ecorse map.

Each room has five puzzle topics: Day 1, Day 2, Day 3, Day 4, and Day 5.

Each puzzle is one try only. Correct answers earn points. Wrong answers lock that puzzle, but you may still try other puzzles in the room.

When you leave through the Locked Emergency Doors, the exam ends. You cannot return from the final score page.

(link: "Choose my name")[(goto: "Student Select")]

