:: Confirm Name
# Confirm Name

You selected:

## $studentName

If this is you, begin the exam. Once you begin, your name cannot be changed inside the game.

(link: "Yes, this is me. Begin exam.")[(set: $nameLocked to true)(goto: "Guard Desk")]

(link: "No, go back to the roster.")[(set: $studentName to "")(goto: "Student Select")]

:: Guard Desk
# Guard Desk

Student: $studentName

The guard slides a paper answer sheet across the desk.

## Exam Rules

Each room contains five puzzles, one from each review day.

You may try any puzzle you want. Each puzzle is one try only.

Correct answer: earn the room points.

Wrong answer: no points, and that puzzle locks.

Rooms stay open. You may return and try other unlocked puzzles.

Show your work on paper. Write the puzzle code before each problem.

Grade denominator: 360 points.

Minimum grade: 50%.

90% or higher becomes 100%.

When you exit through the Locked Emergency Doors, the exam is over.

(link: "Enter the Main Hall")[(goto: "Main Hall")]

:: Main Hall
# Main Hall

Student: $studentName

Current score: $score points
Puzzles attempted: $puzzlesAttempted
Puzzles correct: $puzzlesCorrect

Choose a room. You may come back to the hall after any puzzle.

## Easy Rooms
(link: "Teacher Lounge: Photocopier Prize Lounge (4 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "LNG Room")]

