(link: "Mr. Doss: Slope Claw Machine (4 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "DOS Room")]

(link: "Ms. Deszi: Y-Intercept Snack Bar (4 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "DSZ Room")]

(link: "Mr. Turner: Horizontal Line Air Hockey (4 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "TRN Room")]

(link: "Mr. Moore: Graph Match Skeeball (4 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "MOR Room")]

## Standard Rooms
(link: "Mr. Green: Slope-Intercept Speedway (6 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "GRN Room")]

(link: "Mr. Taylor: Standard Form Vault (6 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "TAY Room")]

(link: "Ms. Iglaisas: Intercept Alley (6 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "IGL Room")]

(link: "Ms. Pritchert: Point-Slope Pop-A-Shot (6 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "PRI Room")]

(link: "Mr. K: Perpendicular Laser Tag (6 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "MRK Room")]

(link: "Mr. Wolfe: Parallel Pinball (6 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "WLF Room")]

## Advanced Rooms
(link: "Mr. Harvey Science: Science Lab Circuit (8 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "HAR Room")]

(link: "Ms. Bowen Science: Word Problem Whack-a-Mole (8 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "BOW Room")]

(link: "Unknown Area: Mystery Circuit Room (8 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "UNK Room")]

## Boss Rooms
(link: "Mr. Forrest: Final Boss Cabinet (12 points per puzzle)")[(goto: "FOR Room")]

## Exit
Do not click this until you are finished. The final score page has no return link.

(link: "Locked Emergency Doors: Finish Exam")[(goto: "Exit Gate")]

:: Exit Gate
# Locked Emergency Doors

Student: $studentName

This is the exam exit. If you continue, your score will be final.

Current score: $score points

Puzzles attempted: $puzzlesAttempted

Puzzles correct: $puzzlesCorrect

(link: "I am finished. Show my final score.")[(set: $examEnded to true)(goto: "Final Score")]

(link: "Not yet. Return to Main Hall.")[(goto: "Main Hall")]

:: Final Score
# Final Exam Score Page

(set: $rawPercent to (round: (($score / 360) * 100)))
(if: $rawPercent >= 90)[(set: $finalGrade to 100)](else-if: $rawPercent < 50)[(set: $finalGrade to 50)](else:)[(set: $finalGrade to $rawPercent)]

## Student: $studentName

Raw score: $score points

Grade denominator: 360 points

Raw percent: $rawPercent%

Final grade: $finalGrade%

Puzzles attempted: $puzzlesAttempted

Puzzles correct: $puzzlesCorrect

## Teacher screenshot page

Take a screenshot of this page and turn in your paper work.

The exam is now closed. There is no return link.


:: LNG Room
# Teacher Lounge: Photocopier Prize Lounge

Difficulty: Easy
Prize: Copper Copy Card
Value: 4 points per correct puzzle

Choose any unlocked puzzle. You may solve more than one puzzle in this room.

Current score: $score points

## Day 1: Combining like terms
Code: LNG-D1
(if: $lngd1Done)[Puzzle locked.](else:)[(link: "Attempt LNG-D1")[(goto: "LNG Day 1")]]

## Day 2: One-step equation
Code: LNG-D2
(if: $lngd2Done)[Puzzle locked.](else:)[(link: "Attempt LNG-D2")[(goto: "LNG Day 2")]]

## Day 3: Identify a function
Code: LNG-D3
(if: $lngd3Done)[Puzzle locked.](else:)[(link: "Attempt LNG-D3")[(goto: "LNG Day 3")]]

## Day 4: Slope from points
Code: LNG-D4
(if: $lngd4Done)[Puzzle locked.](else:)[(link: "Attempt LNG-D4")[(goto: "LNG Day 4")]]

## Day 5: Check a system solution
Code: LNG-D5
(if: $lngd5Done)[Puzzle locked.](else:)[(link: "Attempt LNG-D5")[(goto: "LNG Day 5")]]

(link: "Return to Main Hall")[(goto: "Main Hall")]

:: LNG Day 1
(if: $lngd1Done)[
# LNG-D1: Puzzle Locked

This puzzle has already been attempted.

(link: "Return to Teacher Lounge")[(goto: "LNG Room")]
](else:)[
# LNG-D1: Combining like terms

Room: Teacher Lounge

Difficulty: Easy

Value: 4 points

Write this code on your paper before solving: **LNG-D1**

Simplify: 3x + 4 + 2x + 5

(link: "A. 5x + 9")[(goto: "LNG Day 1 Correct")]

(link: "B. 5x + 1")[(goto: "LNG Day 1 Wrong")]

(link: "C. 6x + 9")[(goto: "LNG Day 1 Wrong")]

(link: "D. x + 9")[(goto: "LNG Day 1 Wrong")]
]

:: LNG Day 1 Correct
(if: $lngd1Done)[
# LNG-D1: Already Locked

This puzzle was already attempted. No extra points can be earned.

(link: "Return to Teacher Lounge")[(goto: "LNG Room")]
](else:)[
(set: $lngd1Done to true)(set: $score to $score + 4)(set: $puzzlesAttempted to $puzzlesAttempted + 1)(set: $puzzlesCorrect to $puzzlesCorrect + 1)
# Correct: LNG-D1

You win the Copper Copy Card.

+4 points

Correct answer: 5x + 9

Explanation: Combine x terms: 3x + 2x = 5x. Combine numbers: 4 + 5 = 9. The result is 5x + 9.

Current score: $score points

(link: "Return to Teacher Lounge")[(goto: "LNG Room")]

(link: "Return to Main Hall")[(goto: "Main Hall")]
]

:: LNG Day 1 Wrong
(if: $lngd1Done)[
