Tickets cost 5 dollars for students and 8 dollars for adults. A group buys 10 tickets for 62 dollars. How many student tickets were bought?

(link: "A. 6 student tickets")[(goto: "HAR Day 5 Correct")]

(link: "B. 4 student tickets")[(goto: "HAR Day 5 Wrong")]

(link: "C. 5 student tickets")[(goto: "HAR Day 5 Wrong")]

(link: "D. 8 student tickets")[(goto: "HAR Day 5 Wrong")]
]

:: HAR Day 5 Correct
